It is based on Firefox VPN (https://github.com/armanlife/firefox-vpn-client),
Copyright (C) Arman, also under the GNU General Public License v3. The
original project's documentation and the Mozilla VPN logo assets that shipped
with it were removed; the product's name, icons, identifiers, and packaging
were changed.

This edition (awmvpn) has no Firefox Account sign-in in the app. Accounts are
provisioned by the awmvpn service: the @awmvpn_bot Telegram bot issues a
subscription token, and the app exchanges it for the account's credentials.
The Firefox Account behind each subscription is operated by the service, and
Mozilla's terms of service apply to that use.

